
@startuml 01_PlayerService

title 1. PlayerService - 플레이어 정보(코인/에너지/닉네임/아바타) 관리

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

class Player {
  - PlayerId: Guid
  - PlayerNickname: string
  - SelectedNationalFlagCode: string
  - CoinBalance: int
  - EnergyPoints: int
  - ActiveZoneId: Guid
  - ActiveLevelId: Guid
  + IncreaseCoinBalance(amountToAdd: int): void
  + DecreaseCoinBalance(amountToSpend: int): bool
  + IncreaseEnergyPoints(amountToAdd: int): void
  + DecreaseEnergyPoints(amountToSpend: int): bool
  + ChangeNickname(newNickname: string): void
  + ChangeSelectedNationalFlag(newNationalFlagCode: string): void
}

interface PlayerRepository {
  + FindPlayerById(playerId: Guid): Task<Player>
  + SavePlayer(player: Player): Task
  + AdjustCoinBalance(playerId: Guid, coinChangeAmount: int): Task
  + AdjustEnergyPoints(playerId: Guid, energyChangeAmount: int): Task
}

interface PlayerService {
  + GetPlayerProfile(playerId: Guid): Result<Player, ServiceError>
  + EarnCoins(playerId: Guid, coinsToAdd: int): Result<Player, ServiceError>
  + SpendCoins(playerId: Guid, coinsToSpend: int): Result<Player, ServiceError>
  + ConsumeEnergy(playerId: Guid, energyToSpend: int): Result<Player, ServiceError>
  + ChangeNickname(playerId: Guid, newNickname: string): Result<Player, ServiceError>
  + ChangeNationalFlag(playerId: Guid, newNationalFlagCode: string): Result<Player, ServiceError>
}

class ServiceError <<see 00_CommonTypes>>

PlayerService ..> PlayerRepository : Task<T> 결과를 기다림(await)
PlayerService ..> Player
PlayerRepository ..> Player
PlayerService ..> ServiceError : 실패 시 반환

note right of PlayerService
  판정(비즈니스 규칙)은 여기서만 처리됨:
  - SpendCoins: 보유 코인보다 많이 쓰려 하면 NotEnoughCoins 실패
  - ConsumeEnergy: 보유 에너지보다 많이 쓰려 하면 NotEnoughEnergy 실패
  - ChangeNickname: 닉네임 형식이 잘못되면 InputWasInvalid 실패
end note

@enduml
